The [[Piggybank]] is an item available in the shop for all characters, at common rarity. It does very little in an actual battle, giving only a maximum of 8 maximum health, with all four {{icon/star}}s filled by start of battle items. If a battle is completed with the [[Piggybank]] in the slots of the character's bag, the "shop entered" effect will trigger and they will gain 1{{icon/gold}}. This can't be achieved by simply leaving the [[Piggybank]] in storage. This {{icon/gold}} gain makes the [[Piggybank]] pay for itself after a single round, and beyond that it becomes economically net-positive, the only drawback being the space it might take up.

